tie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 4 séries. Chaque série est constituée de 2' d'endurance active, suivies par 2' Tempo, puis 2' Sweetspot pour terminer avec 1' de récupération avant de commencer la série suivante.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"1h10 de sortie longue, c'est peu et beaucoup à la fois ! Pour un marathonien, ce serait peu, mais pour toi, coureur qui t'apprêtes à courir un 10km, on commence déjà à être dans des distances vraiment intéressantes !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_30","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Aerobie","value":318,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"aerobie"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":300,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_12","exerciseType":"recupera