s"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'envie d'accélérer sur les footings ? Elle est naturelle, on l'a tous car le footing c'est facile ! Mais il faut absolument te retenir de le faire si tu veux progresser ! Courir plus vite, c'est générer de la fatigue (même un peu) qui va t'empêcher d'être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Affutage_10_600_S2_ HARD2","description":"Séance d'allure spécifique 10 km avec **5 intervalles de 6'** à ton allure 10 km entrecoupés de 3' de récupération.","displayName":"Allure 10 km","coachAdvice":"Sur le papier la séance ta paraîtra abordable. Des fractions de 6' à allure 10 km c'est largement faisable. Mais attention à la récupération qui n'est que de 2' et pourra te sembler bien courte sur les derniers intervalles ! ","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A10_6","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"10km","value":247,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"10km"},"durations":[{"value":6,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":14.05562400985742,"expectedDuration":4500},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":247}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":247}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":247}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":247}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":360,"pace":{"value":247}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_80_HARD_2","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 25' Tempo en continu.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Une sortie longue \"pas trop longue\", c'est le tarif aujourd'hui pas besoin de plus ! En fait, on est plus sur un footing un peu allongé qu'une sortie longue. Tu devrais donc rentrer en bonne forme, prêt(e) à attaquer la suite de l'entraînement !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a68973f0462290c63b40f4a","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1788134400000,"sessionIndex":6,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":1000,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":60,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":4100,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoId":"UMD5Rt1ESQ25KBXonqCm0A","name":"Jus 